# Database

PostgreSQL is the system of record. Match `docs/architecture/database-schema.md`.

On a schema change: model, migration, repository, then that doc. A hard-to-reverse choice also gets an ADR.

`vehicles` is monthly RANGE-partitioned on `created_at` with PK `(id, created_at)`. `id` is an app-minted snowflake. Global VIN uniqueness is `vehicle_vins`. Also: `model_id`, `entered_on`, nullable `stocked_out_on`, nullable `proposed_action`. Stock state is whether `stocked_out_on` is null. Make and model addresses are integer identities (ADR-0011, ADR-0013).
